<title>UK: TENNIS-EASTBOURNE WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EASTBOURNE WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>EASTBOURNE, England 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000 Eastbourne women's grass-court tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Kerry-Anne Guse (Australia) 7-5 6-0</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>8-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 4-6 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>6-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Venus Williams (U.S.) 6-3 5-7 6-4  </p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat 3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>1-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat 7-Kimberley Po (U.S.) 6-3 6-1</p>
</text>
